{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"pumping lemma for context free languages pumping lemma for context free languages","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","fileName":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 22:54\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Context-Free Languages and Parsing]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Context-Free Languages and Parsing","Parse Tree","FoundationsOfComputation_2.3.2.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"pumping lemma for context free languages pumping lemma for context free languages","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","fileName":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","heading":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The context-free pumping lemma says that every sufficiently long string w in a context-free language can be written w = uxyzv, where x and z are not both empty, |xyz| is bounded, and uxⁿyzⁿv remains in the language for every n ≥ 0.\n\nThe two pumped regions arise from a repeated nonterminal along a sufficiently tall [[Parse Tree]] path. As with the regular pumping lemma, the result is used contrapositively to prove that certain languages are not context-free.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Context-Free Languages and Parsing","Parse Tree","FoundationsOfComputation_2.3.2.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"pumping lemma for context free languages pumping lemma for context free languages","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","fileName":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Pumping Lemma for Context-Free Languages","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[FoundationsOfComputation_2.3.2.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Context-Free Languages and Parsing","Parse Tree","FoundationsOfComputation_2.3.2.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}